  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'german-silver-navajo-style-pearl-necklace-extenders-8mm-beads', '4605024471', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4605024471/german-silver-navajo-style-pearl?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT43bca5cdd46b07bb76892516d83696935717bb84&click_sum=010c3918&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-11&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT43bca5cdd46b07bb76892516d83696935717bb84',
   'German Silver Navajo Style Pearl Necklace Extenders ~ 8mm Beads!', 'Jewelry Extender ~ 8mm German Silver Navajo Pearl Style Looking for a little extra somethin''? Choose from our 2", 3", 4", or 5" length options for an ultra customized fit. Perfect for your multi-strand or extra long German Silver necklace. Great for heavier weight necklaces and bracelets made with our larger bead sizes. Handmade with all 8mm German Silver Navajo Pearls. Each Navajo Pearl extender comes with a lobster clasp on one end and jump ring on the other for easy attachment and adjustability. Ships in minimal packaging for eco-conscientiousness! GERMAN SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS~ We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. See our About German Silver Page to learn more. GERMAN SILVER CARE~ Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
