  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-handmade-santa-fe-style-pendant-necklace-german-silver-beads', '4318082880', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4318082880/navajo-pearl-handmade-santa-fe-style?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT4086b47f030069d5ed129eaeeab208152920f696&click_sum=c87e0e98&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT4086b47f030069d5ed129eaeeab208152920f696',
   'Navajo Pearl Handmade Santa Fe Style Pendant Necklace ~ German Silver beads!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! Stunning Western Navajo Pearl & Turquoise Necklace. Navajo Pearls are 6 and 8mm. Artisan Stamped Pendant Size: 1/34" x 1 3/4" CHOOSE YOUR LENGTH! Select your length from the drop-down menu. Choose from a stunning choker, to a traditional look, or an extra-long strand and wrap it around to create multiple looks! Finished with lobster clasp and links of chain for a customizable fit! DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John GERMAN SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two desert pearls are exactly alike! See our About German Silver Page to learn more. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
