  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-handmade-all-5mm-three-row-wrap-bracelet-german-silver-beads', '4319651981', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4319651981/navajo-pearl-handmade-all-5mm-three-row?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT168f845c53836542352ff96681d5da19f1c83cbe&click_sum=02919dc2&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788646-19-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT168f845c53836542352ff96681d5da19f1c83cbe',
   'Navajo Pearl Handmade All 5mm Three Row Wrap Bracelet ~ German Silver beads!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Message us! This beautiful Navajo Pearl three row bracelet is made from 5mm beads. Wrap bracelet with 3 rows of beading on premium memory wire. Flexible design makes this wrap style perfect for any wrist size! Total length is about 24”. DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John OUR NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability.. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them creating perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two pearls are exactly alike! Although not sterling silver, German silver has the same lifelong quality, look, and weight of sterling silver at a fraction of the price! German silver is a durable, beautiful metal and contains trace amounts of nickel. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. (Don’t wear your pearls in the shower, pool, hot tub, or bath y’all!) Do not use silver polish. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
