  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'sterling-silver-navajo-style-round-beads-2mm-16mm-navajo-pearls-authentic', '1523466203', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1523466203/sterling-silver-navajo-style-round-beads?click_key=Eu0aUn4PzowjFtpPTpRLA0MDQ084%3ALTac966a1d2db268f003e887c290e49747355e1ae6&click_sum=c3603495&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788645-19-7&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&bes=1&sts=1',
   'Sterling Silver Navajo Style Round Beads (2mm-16mm) - Navajo Pearls - Authentic', 'Navajo Pearls Sterling Silver 2mm/2.5mm/3mm/4mm/5mm/6mm/8mm/10mm - Round Seamless Bead This is a STERLING SILVER bead . The name Navajo Pearl is widely used for stamped or brushed silver beads with an oxidized finish. This technique originated from traditional Native American silversmithing. This is NOT a Pearl Bead. Bead Sizes: 2mm hole approx. 1mm 2.5mm hole approx. 1mm 3mm hole approx. 0.9mm 4mm hole approx. 1mm 5mm hole approx. 1.2mm 8mm hole approx 2.2mm 10mm hole approx 2.5mm 12mm hole approx 2.5mm 14mm hole approx 2.5mm 16mm hole approx 2.5mm Want Navajo Saucer Beads : https://www.etsy.com/listing/1653667851/oxidized-sterling-silver-navajo-saucer Want Navajo Torpedo Beads : https://www.etsy.com/listing/1635028560/sterling-silver-navajo-oval-beads Want Navajo Teardrop & Textured Oval Beads : https://www.etsy.com/listing/1832039372/navajo-pearl-teardrop-4x6mm-textured Want Navajo Corrugated Saucer Beads: https://www.etsy.com/listing/1840490588/oxidized-sterling-silver-navajo-saucer Want Navajo Corrugated Round Beads : https://www.etsy.com/listing/1851825248/navajo-corrugated-round-beads-sterling 100% satisfaction guaranteed . If for any reason you are not happy with this product you may ship it back. *** See Full Selection of Beads here: https://www.etsy.com/shop/NamiCharmsSupplies?section_id=17596271&ref=shopsection_leftnav_4 See my full collection: http://www.etsy.com/shop/NamiCharmsSupplies Follow me on Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/pages/Nami-Charms/227916245666 *** Please consider purchasing Insurance for orders over $250. Seller can not be responsible for lost packages Add Insurance here : https://www.etsy.com/listing/599935319/usps-domestic-shipping-insurance?ref=shop_home_active_3&frs=1', 'accessories',
