  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'large-vintage-sterling-silver-navajo-turquoise-pendant', '4593839022', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4593839022/large-vintage-sterling-silver-navajo?click_key=Eu0aUn4PzowjFtpPTpRLA0MDQ084%3ALT6d5bb0c1f8dbdb3c2ba7aee84611f180104a9913&click_sum=cccf881b&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788645-19-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1',
   'Large Vintage Sterling Silver Navajo Turquoise Pendant', 'Vintage Unmarked but tested as sterling silver. This bold pendant is 2 3/4" length x 2" wide and features a slightly greenish bluish turquoise. There is matrix and if you run your nail across it does dip into the matrix. It is polish highly and the photos are showing reflection. There is a hook to add to chains. If you need a chain reach out as we have a few in stock. In very good condition. 38.6 grams', 'turquoise-jewelry',
