  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'southwestern-oxidized-sterling-silver-necklace-holy-smoke', '1768909726', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1768909726/southwestern-oxidized-sterling-silver?click_key=Eu0aUn4PzowjFtpPTpRLA0MDQ084%3ALT60350ef15326a68c6d466fe5ac1f6dbb37190d64&click_sum=7678b955&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-788645-19-5&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&bes=1&cns=1&sts=1',
   'Southwestern Oxidized Sterling Silver Necklace, "Holy Smoke"', 'Southwestern Devotion! A strand of 2mm oxidized beads accented with small clusters of 3 and 4mm beads and a cross bead in the center. The beads are 100% raw Sterling silver and are oxidized right here at my shop! Necklace is clasped with your choice of a handmade S-clasp with a hammered texture or a Lobster clasp, and is extendable to 1.5 extra inches. Necklace length is measured from the tip of the clasp to the first ring on the extender, like a neck chain, not just beaded length. Comes "Gift Ready" in box with polishing cloth and care instructions. Handmade in Loveland, Colorado! Please note: Do not assume size by looking at pictures. All dimensions are given.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
