  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'pink-conch-squash-blossom-necklace-sterling-silver-navajo-naja-pendant-southwest', '4586623430', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4586623430/navajo-style-pink-conch-squash-blossom?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALTbe168ed4f3883b868fbcc531a4c4b68f5fbe2e23&click_sum=80ef1378&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-126846-19-7&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALTbe168ed4f3883b868fbcc531a4c4b68f5fbe2e23',
   'Pink Conch Squash Blossom Necklace • Sterling Silver Navajo Naja Pendant • Southwestern Statement Jewelry • Luxury Boho Cowgirl Gift for Her', 'Experience the allure of the American Southwest! Handcrafted in solid sterling silver, this squash blossom necklace is deeply rooted in tradition. It offers a unique blend of heritage and sophisticated charm. At its heart dangles an iconic Naja pendant, a revered symbol of protection and prosperity. The natural pink conch provides a striking yet harmonious contrast against the shine of the sterling silver. This isn''t just an accessory; it''s a wearable piece of art that seamlessly blends Native American history with contemporary sophistication. This is perfect for collectors of Western jewelry, boho enthusiasts, or anyone wanting to add a timeless heirloom piece to their wardrobe. Product Details Length: Adjustable up to 19”. See photo with Buffalo nickel for size reference. Materials: Genuine Pink Conch Shell and Sterling Silver Style: Southwest, Navajo-Inspired Squash Blossom, Western, Boho Chic Pendant Style: Classic Naja Crescent Closure: Secure Hook-and-Eye Whether it’s for yourself or a gift for someone special, your order will arrive beautifully packaged. 🔄 EXCHANGE POLICY Exchanges are welcomed within 7 days of delivery for unworn, undamaged items in original condition. Buyers cover return shipping, and free-shipping orders will have original shipping costs deducted from the exchange credit. Production partners FlowMotionsCreations makes this item with help from Native American Silversmith, NM, United States', 'statement-pieces',
