  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-and-turquoise-lariat-necklace-sterling-silver-native-american-jewel', '4482138715', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4482138715/navajo-pearl-and-turquoise-lariat?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALT0af617ce801c5466cf9336fa08aeb3a3f88d73b8&click_sum=b3b9202c&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-126846-19-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALT0af617ce801c5466cf9336fa08aeb3a3f88d73b8',
   'Navajo Pearl and Turquoise Lariat Necklace. Sterling Silver Native American Jewelry.', 'This gorgeous sterling silver lariat necklace, featuring Navajo pearls and turquoise, is the piece you grab when you want your silver to make a statement. Effortless to wear, yet impossible to ignore! Each Navajo Pearl is linked with solid sterling wire crafted into a rosary-style chain, authentically Native American made and stamped sterling. The Navajo Pearls are 4mm and the necklace length is 18"- 20" with an additional 3 3/4” drop. See photo with Indian head nickel for size reference. As stones are natural, variations in color shades and shapes are to be expected. Whether it’s for yourself or a gift for someone special, your order will arrive beautifully packaged.', 'statement-pieces',
