  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-and-buffalo-indian-head-nickel-coin-bead-necklace-sterling-silver-a', '4532537219', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4532537219/navajo-pearl-and-buffalo-indian-head?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALTd8eca4970cb727ae52d27a4d6734f1ddd9ea94c8&click_sum=1bcca195&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-126846-19-4&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALTd8eca4970cb727ae52d27a4d6734f1ddd9ea94c8',
   'Navajo Pearl and Buffalo Indian Head Nickel Coin Bead Necklace. Sterling Silver and Turquoise Necklace. (C4)', 'This Navajo Pearl necklace with natural turquoise and buffalo nickel bead is part of our coin jewelry line which was handmade right here in New Mexico. The center focal bead was created using two authentic vintage buffalo nickels made into a bead and drilled in such a way that no matter which way your bead is facing, it will remain upright. So, you are able to either have the Indian head or buffalo showing by just swiveling the bead without having to remove the necklace. The full date of 1937 is visible on the Indian head side. This is a one-of-a-kind piece that is sure to bring many compliments and be a conversation starter! The necklace itself is 20 inches in length with an additional 3-inch extension chain that is adorned with additional turquoise and Navajo Pearls. The larger Navajo Pearls are 6mm and the buffalo nickel is approximately 3/4”. The natural turquoise rondelle beads range between 5-10mm. 🎁 Premium Presentation Whether treating yourself or honoring a special man or woman in your life, your order arrives ready for giving. Every order is beautifully presented in signature Flow Motions packaging that perfectly matches the rugged, timeless spirit of the jewelry. 🔗 Complete the Look: See matching pieces here: https://www.etsy.com/shop/FlowMotionsCreations?search_query=buffalo+nickel 🔄 EXCHANGE POLICY Exchanges are welcomed within 7 days of delivery for unworn, undamaged items in original condition. Buyers cover return shipping, and free-shipping orders will have original shipping costs deducted from the exchange credit.', 'statement-pieces',
