  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-necklace-buffalo-nickel-bead-necklace', '4445484731', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4445484731/sterling-silver-navajo-pearl-necklace?click_key=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%3ALTe4598a8d3bd2dc2d021d388c10411c6873e963ef&click_sum=bbb5bd61&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-126846-19-2&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=7734c4c2-8642-4296-ad51-b4d40acfa262%253ALTe4598a8d3bd2dc2d021d388c10411c6873e963ef',
   'Navajo Pearl Necklace. Buffalo Nickel Bead Necklace.', 'As part of our coin jewelry collection, this buffalo nickel Navajo pearl necklace was made right here in New Mexico. These necklaces are crafted with sterling silver 4-9mm Navajo Pearls and using two authentic vintage buffalo nickels handmade into a bead and drilled in such a way that no matter which way your bead is facing, it will remain upright. The necklace is secured with a sterling silver clasp Lengths Available: 16, 18, 20, 22, and 24-inches. If you would like a different length than what is offered, please send me a message prior to purchase. It is such a unique necklace that will surely bring many compliments and certainly be a conversation starter! The coin beads are made from genuine circulated US nickels from the 1930s and earlier. Because these are true vintage coins and not replicas, they show natural signs of age and a time-worn texture. This wear is proof of authenticity and ensures a one-of-a-kind piece! Each order is presented in signature Flow Motions packaging that matches the rugged spirit of the jewelry. Sizing Guide 16 Inches: Choker length (best for smaller necks or high layering). 18 Inches: Sits right at the base of the neck. 20 Inches: Classic collarbone length (standard baseline for men). 22 Inches: Most popular length for men (sits comfortably over a T-shirt). 24 Inches: Longer, heavier drape for a prominent standalone look. (Note: One of the last photos shows the type of beads used in these coin bead pieces.) Complete the Look: See matching pieces here: https://www.etsy.com/shop/FlowMotionsCreations?search_query=buffalo+nickel 🔄 EXCHANGE POLICY Exchanges are welcomed within 7 days of delivery for unworn, undamaged items in original condition. Buyers cover return shipping, and free-shipping orders will have original shipping costs deducted from the exchange credit.', 'statement-pieces',
