   'Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Necklace Extenders ~ 4mm Beads!', 'Jewelry Extender ~ Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Style made with all 4mm beads. Looking for a little extra somethin''? Choose 1", 2", 3", or 4" from the drop-down menu for an ultra customized fit. Perfect for your single-strand, Sterling Silver bracelet or necklace. Great for lighter weight, petite designs- any made with our smaller bead sizes! Extender comes with a lobster clasp on one end and jump ring on the other for easy attachment and adjustability. STERLING SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS~ We hand make this jewelry line with beads of .925 Sterling Silver. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two pearls are exactly alike! This high quality Sterling Silver is noted for its beauty, durability, and shine. STERLING SILVER CARE~ Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS ~ We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with 60 day returns and repairs. *Restrictions may apply. See our Returns Page for more info. 50% OFF PRIORITY SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
